},{"id":2166531,"name":"Teresa Grau","role":"Chica Atlética"},{"id":967161,"name":"Pepe Ocio","role":"Chef Miguel Angel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7ybrvqJd9xNPm2RWO3PtzN5ioBv.jpg"},{"id":1510050,"name":"Alberto Velasco","role":"Bailarín","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cZlbSq2x2WMsYIMNoTmrptSu6Rx.jpg"},{"id":3368205,"name":"Alba Amat","role":"Esposa Conductor"},{"id":3368206,"name":"Jayanth Vishwanath","role":"Tendero"},{"id":3368207,"name":"Nathan Mateo","role":"Yaro"},{"id":3368208,"name":"Miguel Ngu Phan","role":"Dueño Hiper Asia"},{"id":3368209,"name":"Claus Breitfeld","role":"Hombre Elegante Brunch"},{"id":3368210,"name":"Melquiades Fraga","role":"Hombre Boina"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La famiglia ideale","overview":"Per Lucia non c’è niente di più importante che condurre una vita esemplare e mantenere sempre il controllo. Da quando si è sposata, si è presa cura della famiglia facendola diventare, nelle sue intenzioni, perfetta. Tuttavia, le sue certezze cominciano a crollare con l’arrivo di Sara, la fidanzata del figlio che ha alle spalle una famiglia molto diversa da quella per cui lei si è impegnata tanto. Sarà così che Lucia dovrà rivedere le sue convinzioni."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Perfect Family","overview":"Lucía is a woman for whom leading a model life and taking control of her life is the most important thing. Since she got married, she has focused all of her efforts on caring for her family, until achieving what for her is a perfect family. However, her entire world begins to collapse with the arrival of Sara, the girlfriend of her son; a young girl with great freedom and without mincing words who has a very different family from what Lucia always dreamed of as a political family. Now, Lucia must accept that the perfect family was not exactly what she thought."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Lucía cree llevar una vida modélica y tenerlo todo bajo control. Desde que se casó, volcó todos sus esfuerzos en el cuidado de su familia, hasta conseguir lo que ella cree que es el colmo de la mujer perfecta; llegar a los cincuenta sin celulitis, un hijo que te idolatra y un marido que ha aprendido a cerrar la tapa. Sin embargo, todo se empieza a derrumbar el día que aparece Sara, la novia de su hijo; una chica joven, libre y deslenguada, que dinamita todos los valores femeninos en los que Lucía cree fervientemente. A partir de ese momento es cuando descubrirá que ser perfecta no era lo que ella pensaba."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgJls0egZknRBWk1AakqynbdCa1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hPEOBD7eeQh7plm9TYoECNkK4b3.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":826241,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgJls0egZknRBWk1AakqynbdCa1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zgJls0egZknRBWk1AakqynbdCa1.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zgJls0egZknRBWk1AakqynbdCa1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zgJls0egZknRBWk1AakqynbdCa1.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ejRrpBuWj8MNkFP7DUHZoqhuGmV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ejRrpBuWj8MNkFP7DUHZoqhuGmV.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ejRrpBuWj8MNkFP7DUHZoqhuGmV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ejRrpBuWj8MNkFP7DUHZoqhuGmV.jpg","language":"en","width":800,"height":1200}]},"es":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://ima